<description>&lt;p&gt;Al-Shabaab continues probe attacks testing Kenya's border defenses while militia forces killed eight Somali civilians near the Kenya-Ethiopia border. Ugandan troops are withdrawing from Somalia, raising security concerns around Mogadishu, and Uganda has denied reports of its soldiers being killed in the country. Somalia joined 17 nations condemning an Israeli strike on a Gaza hospital, and a Somali refugee woman was killed by Houthi shelling of a camp in Lahj. The conflict produced 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE1vckVTSWFfUjlTckdjNWRfNnJpMHJkdzh4aWZic09LQVFGVkNvTXlIbGtCV0x3VnZ1VHJ4VkFQb0k4ekF2OWYxQ0R5anNJdHJGaWtQcVRwYlNSLVJ6VXfSAWNBVV95cUxQcWhseEI5TFM5SlE0cnRLWTNPMTREdUhxdUwzTF9pTHhIY1FVdjBYWmZRcDVwWXVTOGJxd0k2LWduZ3ZRZ1NCaGFuUHpNa25zSWdIVlpuTVVqcGJyY055RDAwQmc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMif0FVX3lxTE51UTluOTZVRjhhNXVKSkVENmc1aUlVbGZsR1A2cldlU1QyVXZhd1p4Nmpuak8zM19KUWhLSlBOa1k1T3lkTXlDT2V3YWc5T3NnZXRqSmJQR1o1Ums2enFFNU44YWM1WFd0V2RNUlVXSjBmVVBnTVFRdTAxN3RzZmc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eurasia Review&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidkFVX3lxTE9rdjFsdldJSUtrbjBDenI0T2pmWHBBUi1GbFBtYkhUNmI5ak0zZXR6aUtSNkVKUk80NGZiaXE0YURjOEdDSm5JMHJQOUtQLV9WTTBhU0JpZ1lSUG5yM1VhU1A3S3NhZ00yWGJ2aEoxR29rQmNjZVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;يمن مونيتور&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxPa3VzdjVHcWtGOFZjYVBoVlJ6MHF3ZnZjRGlXWkVzeUZxcnk2QnVXdzR4SkJOaEFtNXpEcHlBSEsyZXJ5dDFYVXR6ZlloUnpvY2gwQUVIZE4yVkhwWjlfV0R1N25mb2J2RDFWZDUwTEVRclFIOXBvak04bEJwRW9SMFQ4TkZMd1p5ZEkyRWFpemlWM3lnaXNNTzIzcEtpUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawan Africa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Saudi Gazette&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.